; Exact local/raw-memory/expression ownership for gen_call() procedure32.
;
; The adjacent control module owns procedure/block/effect/decoded shape.  This
; module has no initialization edge and publishes no semantic token.  It fixes
; every local, raw-memory, primitive, and push row, then exhausts all six source
; table families over blocks150..166.

